  m_text: "What this shader reads: a gradient, bright at the lamp and fading toward the floor; and the view direction, so the cone fades where its surface turns away from the camera and has no hard outline. It is added on top of what is behind it. It reads no lights and no shadows.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>File: Packages \u203A Toolbox \u203A Shaders \u203A Light-And-Space \u203A Fake-Beam.shader \xB7 The-Flooded-Arcade, 5 \xB7 Real or fake</color></size>"
