      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "What this shader reads: time, its height in the world, and the lights and their shadows. Below Water Height it adds a moving net of light to the pool tiles, wherever a light reaches them, and fades it with depth. It is the tiles' own material, so it holds from every side.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>File: Packages \u203A Toolbox \u203A Shaders \u203A Light-And-Space \u203A Caustics.shader \xB7 Shader-Library-Surfaces, 2 \xB7 Water</color></size>"
